 The painted buoy, once a bright blue, now a faded, yet still radiant, reflection of the sun's warmth. A reminder of memories made, and moments shared beneath its watchful, yet ever-dulling gaze. The sound of gentle lapping waves, and the soft rustling of seagulls, all blend together in an soothing harmony, as I sit here, reflecting on the beauty of this harbor note. A moment of peace, a moment of serenity, and a moment of appreciation for the simple things in life.
